ss\",\"evidence\":[\"ready-for-impl-lead-commit\"],\"reasoning\":\"The story is ready for impl-lead to create the required commit.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-1.1 through AC-1.8\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"Verifier 006 reports AC-1.1 through AC-1.8 remain verified by Story 1 tests and passing gates.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Verifier found no open findings for queue order, background/manual modes, crash recovery, live-lease exclusion, unknown-kind failure, and drain reporting.\"},{\"name\":\"AC-1.9 / TC-1.8 including migrated rows\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"Verifier 006 marks 01F-001 resolved and verifies fresh v5 rows plus upgraded Epic 01 queued rows.\",\"Implementor 005 added work-execution-legacy.test.ts coverage for retry exhaustion and non-retryable terminal failure on legacy NULL-payload rows.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Terminal failure now stamps failed forms before deleting work rows for both fresh and migrated queue rows.\"},{\"name\":\"Architecture-risk tests\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"Verifier 006 reports verify-all passed with 173 tests across 21 files, including the process suite.\",\"Implementor 003 reported spawned SIGKILL crash recovery, cross-process live-lease exclusion, coalesced burst, and backoff head-gating coverage.\"],\"reasoning\":\"The load-bearing process and queue ordering risks have direct test evidence.\"},{\"name\":\"Verification gates\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"Verifier 006: pnpm run green-verify passed.\",\"Verifier 006: pnpm run verify-all passed.\"],\"reasoning\":\"Configured story and epic gates are green.\"},{\"name\":\"Spec deviations\",\"status\":\"pass\",\"evidence\":[\"Impl-lead ruling 001-ruling-response-001.json approved all seven deviations and states none alter epic contracts or AC semantics.\"],\"reasoning\":\"The only authority-boundary issue was resolved by impl-lead approval.\"}],\"callerInputHistory\":{\"reviewRequests\":[],\"rulings\":[{\"rulingRequestId\":\"01-queue-execution-drain-story-run-001-ruling-spec-deviation\",\"decision\":\"approve\",\"rationale\":\"All seven deviations approved: (1) HandlerOutcome.forms additive extension centralizes the version-checked UPDATE + row deletion in complete()'s single transaction — this strengthens the anti-shim 'one form-write path' rule rather than weakening it; (2) fail-closed background gating on an empty handler map protects pinned Story 0 tests and only defers scheduling that could do nothing useful; (3) provider_not_configured error code is named by DD-11, its absence from the interface list was a spec omission; (4) deterministic provider in src/providers/ is required for spawned CLI tests to reach the registry through dist/cli.js per the test plan's no-test-only-path rule; (5) payload { sourceVersion, forms } extension keeps terminal paths domain-blind; (6) attempts/lastError in DerivedFormMetadata JSON satisfies DD-1's copy-at-exhaustion without schema churn; (7) red-manifest regeneration for new red-phase files is the sanctioned mechanism. None alter epic contracts or AC semantics.\",\"source\":\"impl-lead\"}]},\"runtimeIdentity\":{\"version\":\"0.4.0\",\"invocationSource\":\"unknown\",\"entryPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/lspec-core/dist/bin/lbuild-impl.js\"},\"replayBoundary\":null,\"logHandoff\":{\"recommendedState\":\"NEEDS_RULING\",\"recommendedCurrentStory\":\"01-queue-execution-drain\",\"recommendedCurrentPhase\":\"story-orchestrate\",\"continuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"b93e566a-c98e-4b05-8100-3f1a70ca0688\",\"storyId\":\"01-queue-execution-drain\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019eb4d6-3996-71f3-9029-a0c7a13e47b4\",\"storyId\":\"01-queue-execution-drain\"}},\"storyReceiptDraft\":{\"storyId\":\"01-queue-execution-drain\",\"storyTitle\":\"Story 1: Queue Execution and Drain\",\"implementorEvidenceRefs\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/packages/lhc/docs/02-specs/02-derivation-pipeline/artifacts/01